    "23": {
      "status": "reviewed",
      "sourceText": "おう、兄ちゃん、変わった格好してんな。旅の途中か?どうだい、ちょっと見てかねえか？",
      "sourceSpeaker": "果物屋の店主",
      "translation": "哟，小哥，穿得挺特别啊。\n正在旅行吗？怎么样，\n要不要过来看看？",
      "notes": "\ndata/localization/ja-originals/main/rezelos-2020-scene-10010001.json；SHA-256 8d99af5d45b7470765e8a6f8d5d40e3a43c52c1a1aab9bcda8636e1ee45a557d；原版 scenario_id=23。",
      "recordings": [
        {
          "recordingId": "bili-capital-02",
          "bvid": "BV1bK4y1a7Fm",
          "cid": 235287283,
          "p": 2,
          "start": 179.9,
          "end": 199.7667,
          "visualTime": 181.4,
          "localDuration": 246.823,
          "timeMapping": "same-recording-seconds"
        }
      ],
      "nativeIdOrigin": "captured",
      "issues": [],
      "studioNodeId": "node_b6addcab5262",
      "branches": [
        {
          "branchId": 1025,
          "studioEdgeId": "edge_f22fcd504885",
          "sourceLabel": "果物を見る",
          "sourceQuote": "この色と形、完全にリンゴだよな！\nこっちでも\n初恋みたいな甘酸っぱい味すんの？",
          "labelTranslation": "查看水果",
          "quoteTranslation": "这颜色和形状，完全就是苹果嘛！\n这里的苹果，\n也有像初恋一样酸酸甜甜的味道吗？"
        },
        {
          "branchId": 1026,
          "studioEdgeId": "edge_451d6c686059",
          "sourceLabel": "看板を見る",
          "sourceQuote": "言葉は通じるのに、\nなんて書いてあるのかは全然読めねぇな",
          "labelTranslation": "查看招牌",
          "quoteTranslation": "明明语言能沟通，\n写着的字却一个也看不懂啊。"
        }
      ]
    },
    "24": {
      "status": "reviewed",
      "sourceText": "初恋ぃ？　面白えこと言うな、兄ちゃん。\nそいつはリンガだよ、リンガ",
      "sourceSpeaker": "果物屋の店主",
      "translation": "初恋？小哥，你说话真有意思。\n那是凛果，凛果啦。",
      "notes": "data/localization/ja-originals/main/rezelos-2020-scene-10010001.json；SHA-256 8d99af5d45b7470765e8a6f8d5d40e3a43c52c1a1aab9bcda8636e1ee45a557d；原版 scenario_id=24。原稿补全果物を見る分支；此录像未走该分支，时间仅为编辑定位。\ndata/localization/ja-originals/main/rezelos-2020-scene-10010001.json；SHA-256 8d99af5d45b7470765e8a6f8d5d40e3a43c52c1a1aab9bcda8636e1ee45a557d；原版 scenario_id=24。",
