    "25": {
      "status": "reviewed",
      "sourceText": "リンガ、１個銅貨2枚だ。こんなのも読めなくて大丈夫かよ？",
      "sourceSpeaker": "果物屋の店主",
      "translation": "凛果，一个两枚铜币。\n连这个都看不懂，你真没问题吗？",
      "notes": "\ndata/localization/ja-originals/main/rezelos-2020-scene-10010001.json；SHA-256 8d99af5d45b7470765e8a6f8d5d40e3a43c52c1a1aab9bcda8636e1ee45a557d；原版 scenario_id=25。",
