      "status": "reviewed",
      "sourceText": "で、リンガ、どうだ？",
      "sourceSpeaker": "果物屋の店主",
      "translation": "所以，要不要来个凛果？",
      "notes": "\ndata/localization/ja-originals/main/rezelos-2020-scene-10010001.json；SHA-256 8d99af5d45b7470765e8a6f8d5d40e3a43c52c1a1aab9bcda8636e1ee45a557d；原版 scenario_id=26。",
